    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9448" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντανα-πληρόω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>fill up,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν θέσιν τοῦ ὀνόματος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.D.
					<u>Synt.</u>
					14.1
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ὑστερήματα τῶν θλίψεων τοῦ
					Χριστοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ep.Col.</u>
					1.24
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. πρὸς τὸν εὐπορώτατον ἀεὶ
				τοὺς ἀπορωτάτους</span>
			<i>put in</i> the poorest <i>so as to balance</i> the richest,
				<i><span class="en">
				D.
				14.17
			</span></i>.</div>
